w.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/wsj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj_2431/202607/t20260721_2261859.htm", "fileext": "xlsx", "_src": "/protect/P0202607/P020260721/P020260721612053237480.xlsx", "_href": "http://wjw.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/wsj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj_2431/202607/P020260721612053237480.xlsx"}], "_docpuburl": "http://wjw.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/wsj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj_2431/202607/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2195140, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "医政管理", "chnldocurl": "http://wjw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/zcjd/202603/t20260318_2195140.htm", "content": "一、文件起草背景和依据\n2003年，原省卫生厅颁发了《福建省卫生厅关于颁发〈关于卫生行政处罚中适用听证程序的较大数额罚款标准的规定〉的通知》（闽卫法监〔2003〕133号），规定对公民的违法行为处以5千元以上的，以", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://wjw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/zcjd/202603/t20260318_2195140.htm", "docreltime": "2026.03.18 08:53:00", "doctitle": "《关于卫生健康行政处罚中较大数额罚款标准的规定》政策解读", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2426277, "sourcename": "福建省卫生健康委员会", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://wjw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/zcjd/202603/t20260318_2195140.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://wjw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/zcjd/202603/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2174158, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "医政管理", "chnldocurl": "http://wjw.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/wsj/zfxxgkml/jgzn_19325/202512/t20251203_2174158.htm", "content": " 大田县卫健局：  你局关于《申请增加大田县总医院核定设置床位的请示》（田卫函〔2025〕83号）收悉。经研究决定，同意大田县总医院增加床位130张，核定床位总数为450张。请按照《医疗机构管理条例》及其实施细", "docabstract": "床位批复", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "三明市卫生健康委员会 关于同意大田县总医院增加核定床位的批复", "docpuburl": "http://wjw.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/wsj/zfxxgkml/jgzn_19325/202512/t20251203_2174158.htm", "docreltime": "2025.12.03 10:06:00", "doctitle": "三明市卫生健康委员会关于同意大田县总医院增加核定床位的批复", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "明卫〔2025〕65号", "idxid": "SM00123-0500-2025-00010", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "2025.11.26 00:00:00", "puborg": "三明市卫生健康委员会", "recid": 2404314, "sourcename": "三明市卫健委医政科", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://wjw.sm.gov.cn/sz