作方案》和《福建省2024—2026年乡镇卫生院定向培养医学人才工作方案》的通知.pdf", "appdocid": 2016769, "appfile": "P020240411359757731607.pdf", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://wjw.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/wsj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj_2431/202404/t20240411_2016769.htm", "fileext": "pdf", "_src": "/protect/P0202404/P020240411/P020240411359757731607.pdf", "_href": "http://wjw.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/wsj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj_2431/202404/P020240411359757731607.pdf"}], "_docpuburl": "http://wjw.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/wsj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj_2431/202404/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2000183, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "医政管理", "chnldocurl": "http://wjw.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/wsj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj_2431/202402/t20240205_2000183.htm", "content": "各县（市、区）卫健局、人社局，市卫健委直属各单位：\n　　为贯彻落实《三明市中医药事业高质量发展行动计划（2022-2025年）》，切实加强中医药学的继承和创新，培育、宣传为推进中医药事业发展和维护人民健康作出突", "docabstract": "名中医评选办法", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://wjw.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/wsj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj_2431/202402/t20240205_2000183.htm", "docreltime": "2024.02.04 09:19:00", "doctitle": "三明市卫生健康委员会 三明市人力资源和社会保障局关于印发《三明市名中医评选办法（试行）》的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "01", "fileno": "明卫规〔2024〕1号", "idxid": "SM00123-0200-2024-00001", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "2024.02.04 00:00:00", "puborg": "三明市卫生健康委员会", "recid": 2205865, "sourcename": "三明市卫健委中医药与科技教育科", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://wjw.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/wsj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj_2431/202402/t20240205_2000183.htm", "ztcx": "有效", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://wjw.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/wsj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj_2431/202402/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1939868, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "医政管理", "chnldocurl": "http://wjw.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/wsj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj_2431/202309/t20230905_1939868.htm", "content": "\n各县（市、区）委人才办、卫健局、财政局、人社局，市直医疗卫生健康单位：\n　　根据《中共三明市委人才工作领导小组关于印发<三明市实施新时代人才强市战略推进“2+3+N”人才专项行动方案>的通知》（明委人才〔202", "docabstract": "医疗人才补助、柔性引才补助", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://wjw.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/wsj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj_2431/202309/t20230905_1939868.htm", "docreltime": "2023.08.31 16:38:00", "d